#: operators/model_edit.py:112
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Separate MMD model into multiple models based on selected bones.\n\nWARNING: This operation will split meshes, armatures, rigid bodies and joints. To move models before separating, only adjust the root (cross under the model) transformation. Do not move armatures, meshes, rigid bodies, or joints directly before separating as they will not move together.\n\nIMPORTANT: Don't use any of the 'Assembly' functions before using this function. This function requires the model to be in a clean state."
msgstr "根据所选骨骼将 MMD 模型分离为多个模型。\n\n警告：此操作会拆分网格、骨架、刚体和关节。若要在分离前移动模型，只能调整根（模型下方的十字）的变换。分离前请勿直接移动骨架、网格、刚体或关节，否则它们不会一起移动。\n\n重要：使用此功能前请勿使用任何「装配」功能。此功能要求模型处于干净状态。"

#: operators/misc.py:133
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Separate by Materials"
msgstr "按材质分离"

#: operators/misc.py:134
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Separate the mesh into multiple objects based on materials.\n\nWARNING: This operation is not reversible and may cause various issues. It splits adjacent geometry by material, and merging later will not reconnect shared edges.\nKnown issues include potential mesh corruption, UV mapping problems, and other unpredictable behaviors. Use with extreme caution and backup your work first."
msgstr "根据材质将网格分离为多个物体。\n\n警告：此操作不可逆，可能导致各种问题。它会按材质拆分相邻几何体，之后合并时不会重新连接共享边。\n已知问题包括潜在的网格损坏、UV 映射问题以及其他不可预测的行为。请极其谨慎地使用，并先备份工作。"

